---
title: "Photographs — mockup"
description: "Unlisted mockup. A sample library of Franconia photographs for Photo of the month and the Heritage Museum."
permalink: /mockups/photos/archive/
bodyClass: page mockup
mockSlug: archive
---
{% from "partials/mock-photo.njk" import photoImg, libraryCredit %}
<main id="main" class="in page civic mock-page" data-pagefind-ignore>
  <aside class="mock-note" aria-label="Mockup note">
    <p><b>F · Photograph library</b> Past photographs and a Heritage Museum sample, newest first, with one then-and-now pair.</p>
    <p class="mock-note-row">
      <a href="{{ '/mockups/photos/' | url }}">All mockups</a>
    </p>
  </aside>
  <header class="civic-head">
    <h1 class="page-title">{{ "Photographs" | balancedTitle | safe }}</h1>
    <p class="lede">A sample library for Photo of the month and the Franconia Heritage Museum. Newest first. These are licensed stand-ins, not a town collection.</p>
  </header>

  <section class="then-now" aria-labelledby="then-now-heading">
    <h2 id="then-now-heading" class="sign"><span class="blaze" aria-hidden="true"></span>Then &amp; now</h2>
    <p class="mock-aside">Artist's Bluff, looking across Echo Lake in Franconia Notch. The postcard and the later photograph are the same overlook, not the same framing.</p>
    <div class="then-now-pair">
      {% for item in photos %}
      {% if item.pair == "notch" and item.pairRole == "then" %}
      <button type="button" class="then-now-card" data-photo-open-id="{{ item.id }}" data-photo-scope="pair" data-photo-pair="notch">
        {{ photoImg(item, "eager", "(min-width: 700px) 46vw, 100vw", "high") }}
        <span class="then-now-label"><b>Then</b> {{ item.label }}</span>
      </button>
      {% endif %}
      {% endfor %}
      {% for item in photos %}
      {% if item.pair == "notch" and item.pairRole == "now" %}
      <button type="button" class="then-now-card" data-photo-open-id="{{ item.id }}" data-photo-scope="pair" data-photo-pair="notch">
        {{ photoImg(item, "lazy", "(min-width: 700px) 46vw, 100vw", "") }}
        <span class="then-now-label"><b>Now</b> {{ item.label }}</span>
      </button>
      {% endif %}
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </section>

  <h2 id="library-heading" class="sign"><span class="blaze" aria-hidden="true"></span>All photographs</h2>
  <div class="photo-filters">
    <div class="photo-filter-row" role="group" aria-labelledby="filter-collection">
      <span id="filter-collection" class="photo-filter-name">Collection</span>
      <button type="button" data-photo-filter="collection" data-photo-value="all" aria-pressed="true">All</button>
      <button type="button" data-photo-filter="collection" data-photo-value="Photo of the month" aria-pressed="false">Photo of the month</button>
      <button type="button" data-photo-filter="collection" data-photo-value="Heritage Museum" aria-pressed="false">Heritage Museum</button>
    </div>
    <div class="photo-filter-row" role="group" aria-labelledby="filter-place">
      <span id="filter-place" class="photo-filter-name">Place</span>
      <button type="button" data-photo-filter="place" data-photo-value="all" aria-pressed="true">All places</button>
      <button type="button" data-photo-filter="place" data-photo-value="Franconia village" aria-pressed="false">Franconia village</button>
      <button type="button" data-photo-filter="place" data-photo-value="Franconia Notch" aria-pressed="false">Franconia Notch</button>
      <button type="button" data-photo-filter="place" data-photo-value="Gale River" aria-pressed="false">Gale River</button>
      <button type="button" data-photo-filter="place" data-photo-value="Bald Mountain" aria-pressed="false">Bald Mountain</button>
    </div>
  </div>
  <p class="photo-filter-status" data-photo-status role="status"></p>
  <ul class="photo-grid">
    {% for item in photos %}
    <li data-photo-card data-photo-id="{{ item.id }}" data-collection="{{ item.collection }}" data-place="{{ item.place }}">
      <button type="button" class="photo-card" data-photo-open-id="{{ item.id }}" data-photo-scope="filtered" aria-label="View larger photograph, {{ item.label }}, {{ item.place }}, {{ item.credit }}">
        {{ photoImg(item, "lazy", "(min-width: 1000px) 360px, (min-width: 700px) 46vw, 100vw", "") }}
        <span class="photo-card-copy">
          <b>{{ item.label }}</b>
          <span>{{ item.place }}</span>
          <span>{{ item.credit }}</span>
        </span>
      </button>
    </li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ul>

  <h2 class="sign"><span class="blaze" aria-hidden="true"></span>Photograph credits</h2>
  <ul class="photo-credits">
    {% for item in photos %}
    <li>{{ item.place }}, {{ item.label }}. {{ libraryCredit(item) | safe }}{% if "BY-SA" in item.license %} These copies stay under the same license as the original.{% endif %}</li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ul>
  <p class="mock-aside">Stand-ins only. A real photograph of the month would be a resident’s picture, credited with the name they asked to use.</p>
  {% include "partials/mock-viewer.njk" %}
</main>
